Carried fix for V8 crbugs 582863246 and 587226188 "[compiler] Prevent
MapRef instance_type TOCTOU and offset overflow": MapRef::instance_type() and the
MapRef::Is*Map() predicates use the instance type cached in MapData while the broker
serializes, and the compiler's and Maglev's callers query MapRef predicates instead of
reading live Map objects in the sandbox. Also: ElementAccessInfo::elements_kind_ starts
at NO_ELEMENTS for prototype-proxy element accesses, the is_proxy_on_prototype() check
comes before the TypedArray ones, and escape analysis guards its element offset
calculations against signed 32-bit overflow.

From V8's 15.8 branch commit 1db26676c2c375e2c4d246a024343fc55c982629
(refs/branch-heads/15.8@{#97}, cherry-picked from main 3b7df01dbd59), whose parent is
27793d23b4b3 (15.8.62.47), the V8 that 158's DEPS pins at 8127@{#1936}. It is in
15.8.62.48 (805ebcf86730); 158 hasn't rolled V8 past 15.8.62.47 yet. Drop this patch
once 158's V8 roll includes it. This commit has no tests.

